{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14920","headline":"同耿拾遗春中题第四郎新修书院 · 卢纶","name":"同耿拾遗春中题第四郎新修书院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得接西园会，多因野性同。\n引藤连树影，移石间花丛。\n学就晨昏外，欢生礼乐中。\n春游随墨客，夜宿伴潜公。\n散帙灯惊燕，开帘月带风。\n朝朝在门下，自与五侯通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}